# "A single creature you control": Lightning Bolt at Bot2's Llanowar Elves targets a creature, but not one Bot1 controls, so nothing is
# copied (the Bolt at Bot1's own Elves is copied in leyline-of-resonance-copy-of-lightning-bolt-may-be-aimed-at-a-new-target).

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Life = 20
